/-! # Polygraph/Omega/InvolutionDemonstrator — the walking involution as a dim-3 Squier demonstrator
(OMEGA-4 r1, B2)

★ **The picked walker: the walking involution `<s | s.s => id>`.**  It is the SMALLEST presentation (one
0-cell, one endo-1-generator `s`, one rewrite rule `rho : ss => id`) AND — uniquely among the walkers — the
one whose rewriting is genuinely CONVERGENT (`InvolutionDecision.lean`: terminating length-monotone,
confluent parity-NF funnel), so the classical Squier convergent-implies-coherent story literally applies.
Its shipped decision (`fxInvolution_hasOneCellWordProblemDecided`) lives at the 1-CELL level (the
