## The presentation as a 2-polygraph (Squier reading)

  * 0-cells: one object `involutionPoint`.
  * 1-cells: freely generated by `involutionSGen : point => point`; words are `s^n`.
  * 2-cells (the rewrite rule): ONE generator `involutionRhoGen : ss => id` (the involution law oriented
